00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.218
that I recorded for the album

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:27.377
and I was actually going to
call the album Masterpiece

00:06:27.377 --> 00:06:29.075
and I just thought it doesn't make sense.

00:06:29.075 --> 00:06:30.143
If people hear it on its own,

00:06:30.143 --> 00:06:32.767
it just sounds like I'm
being an absolute asshole,

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:35.697
but for me, I've never made it.

00:06:35.697 --> 00:06:36.881
I've never finished my painting.

00:06:36.881 --> 00:06:40.114
Until the day that my eyes
close and I don't wake up,

00:06:40.114 --> 00:06:43.285
I feel like I'm still putting
towards my masterpiece

00:06:43.285 --> 00:06:45.245
and I want to work hard

00:06:45.245 --> 00:06:48.354
and I'm okay to say,
"Hey, I've messed up."

00:06:48.354 --> 00:06:50.215
I do things, I say things, I wear things,

00:06:50.215 --> 00:06:52.148
I date people I shouldn't,

00:06:52.148 --> 00:06:54.873
but I'm human and we're
all building on something

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:59.040
that we hope can leave a
standing of the test of time.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.264
And I think that that's
what that song means to me

00:07:02.264 --> 00:07:04.467
and I've really, really
put it towards other people

00:07:04.467 --> 00:07:06.707
that've gone, "You can't do this,"

00:07:06.707 --> 00:07:10.184
